      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, can you help me draft a performance review for one of my Senior Account Executives? I need it to look professional. He's been doing great with client retention and keeping our big accounts happy, but he's been having some issues with showing up on time for our internal morning stand-up meetings. I want to keep it constructive so he doesn't get defensive, but I need to make sure he knows he needs to fix the punctuality thing.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
